agent_creation: UserInputRequest : Based on your clarification that the agent should create new roles and assign AI agents to those roles, and that all other requirements (departments, user status, project enhancements) are acceptable, I have designed the following SQL schema modifications.

Please review the statements carefully. I need your explicit permission to execute them. Reply with 'yes' to confirm.

SQL Statements:

1. Create Departments table:
```sql
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS Departments (
  departmentID INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,
  department_name TEXT NOT NULL
);
```

2. Add status and department_id columns to Users table:
```sql
ALTER TABLE Users ADD COLUMN status TEXT DEFAULT 'active';
ALTER TABLE Users ADD COLUMN department_id INTEGER;
```

3. Add description, descembeddings, startDate, and endDate columns to Projects table:
```sql
ALTER TABLE Projects ADD COLUMN description TEXT;
ALTER TABLE Projects ADD COLUMN descembeddings BLOB;
ALTER TABLE Projects ADD COLUMN startDate DATETIME;
ALTER TABLE Projects ADD COLUMN endDate DATETIME;
```

4. Insert a default role 'Employee' (if not already present) to ensure there is always a role available for assignments:
```sql
